ou in command of a spaceship in frantic time trials, overcoming multiple challenges. Prove your skill as a galactic pilot and become the fastest in the galaxy!\n\nUPDATED! 1.2.1\n\nTHIS VERSION INCLUDES:\n- Demo mode with one map\n- 4 races, 2 challenge modes (Time Trial and Portals)\n\nTHE FULL VERSION WILL INCLUDE:\n- 3 complete maps. New ones will be added in future updates.\n\n- Time Trial mode: Get comfortable in your cockpit and beat the races within the time limit.\n\n- Portals mode: Demonstrate your cockpit skills by traversing portals during your race within the time limit.\n\n- Shooting mode: Stay focused and fire your ship at the targets you encounter along the course within the time limit.\n\n- Special mode: Show off your skills with this mode that combines all the challenges into one race. Be careful not to lose control, or you won't make it in time.\n\n- Challenge Mode: You can compete against other players on any level in real time. Only the best players will be available to challenge.\n\nNOTE: The game is under development and will be updated with any suggestions received that might fit into this adventure.\n\ndev.level04@gmail.com", "short_description": "Pilot your ship at full speed in time trials through galactic circuits, overcoming multiple challenges and demonstrating your skill as a space pilot"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/lunarchrono/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Level04", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/lunarchrono", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recomm